              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etejenu eoŋ kes ekonikiror, ido etejenuni, tetere amina nakiminar eoŋ ejaun tomakec, eoŋ da tomakec.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
